## Key Concepts
- Per-key in-memory or stateful session store with a 30-second TTL
- Idempotent emits using a deterministic sessionId (userId:start)
- Out-of-order arrivals handled via lastEventTs and session boundaries
- At-least-once delivery guaranteed by committing offsets only after emit

## Code Example
